# Dependencies / build artifacts (reinstalled or rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# Secrets & local data (provided at runtime via env_file / volume mounts)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.local
resume.json
agent-context.md
logs
data
**/*.db*

# VCS / tooling / OS
.git
.gitignore
*.log
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
